editor_description = "Where the viewer's eye is while the bat is held, in first person (the root's View Camera). The arms are not drawn then: the bat floats in the view.

Tick Preview (top left of the 3D view, with this node selected) to see the picture. Move and turn this node to change where the bat sits. In the game it is a place only: nothing looks through it."

[node name="ViewPlayer" type="AnimationPlayer" parent="."]
